Package: svoya-session
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         dbus-user-session,
         greetd,
         hyprland (>= 0.53.3~),
         hyprland (<< 0.54~),
         hyprland-plugin-hyprbars,
         quickshell,
         svoya-shell,
         xdg-desktop-portal-gtk,
         xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
Recommends: gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring, xdg-user-dirs
Description: SOS desktop session (Hyprland + SOS Shell)
 The Wayland session of SOS: the session launcher (environment, keyboard
 layout, Hyprland with the SOS configuration from /usr/share/svoya/hypr),
 the greeter session for greetd (Hyprland running the Quickshell greeter as
 the "svoya-greeter" system user) and the portal preferences.
